Sync Facebook Page comments for registered [[facebook_comments]] profiles. Scan returned organic, visitor and ad posts, retaining independent resumable progress for each surface. Tokens come from the daemon environment. Partial writes stay searchable; missing or inaccessible objects never delete archived history.

Usage:
  msgvault source facebook-comments sync [identifier] [flags]

Flags:
      --build-cache        refresh analytics cache after this sync
      --full               restart selected source scans with fresh cursors; preserve and update archived rows
  -h, --help               help for sync
      --max-requests int   maximum API reads per Page, including identity checks (default 1000)
      --no-build-cache     skip analytics cache refresh after this sync

Global Flags: --agent-allow-insecure, --agent-token-file, --agent-url, --config, --home, --local, --log-file, --log-level, --log-sql, --log-sql-slow-ms, --no-log-file, -v/--verbose (see 'msgvault --help')
